Error [E0067]: `__reserved` is reserved for Jet
  --> tests/ui/dunder_retired_bit_operator.jet:1:4
    |
  1 | fn __reserved() { print(1 | 2) }
    |    ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Double-underscore names belong to the compiler, generated binders, debugger, serializer, and tools
 Fix: Rename it without the second leading underscore
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0067

Error [E0398]: This arithmetic spelling is retired; use `bit_or`
  --> tests/ui/dunder_retired_bit_operator.jet:1:27
    |
  1 | fn __reserved() { print(1 | 2) }
    |                           ^
 Why: Marks express ownership and outcomes; arithmetic uses named methods (D-SIGIL-ALGEBRA1=B)
 Fix: Write `value.bit_or(other)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0398
